{"accountName": "丁爸情报分析师的工具箱", "author": "丁爸情报分析师的工具箱", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "丁爸 情报分析师的工具箱 2026-10-27 10:16 四川", "type": "p"}, {"text": "第六届全国开源情报技术大会会议议程。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/no8YFGgia2NHbhD0tKIXbY0lSrkpTmDWstibXeCwCos5PkPUe7TyMaCD96Z2WaHAz3hG9cm4miaE0mPkib3Dpd3CZhibrzvYmf2snWJOjCGkXRRQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "会 议 议 程", "type": "p"}, {"text": "第六届全国开源情报技术大会（ COSINT 2026）", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2026 年 11 月 13—15 日　·　贵州 · 贵阳　｜　2026-10-26 版 · 上午 9:00 起始 · 内部工作稿", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 2, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/no8YFGgia2NHKbCIuSsgGwAOh44nLsmb2ibylzs296BnUeAYNVkhMNDZQzWs2CQQn9nMLQ6ZXSKK302obCQB539OclH1w3ibqezws8xcJuqyGs/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "一、会议概况", "type": "p"}, {"text": "主办单位", "type": "p"}, {"text": "中国中文信息学会开源情报技术专业委员会", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "图片", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/no8YFGgia2NEjO0j0My9tAO19AsYXgicIU3QGafbCaoPrqib1v8hyLtamaXManFzA72jLY1AfY4ueyEjlYCHk4x4jSRpWwEafqfUETqS5Hic39A/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg&watermark=1&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&tp=webp#imgIndex=0", "type": "img"}, {"text": "承办单位", "type": "p"}, {"text": "贵州大学　贵州警察学院", "type": "p"}, {"text": "会议时间", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "图片", "src": "https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/no8YFGgia2NE2Ydx2bMDn4ichWnuPaeSfIqKic90ayvXibibk3FoibnqemQU1C00H1squIqd5gFb3NVvszfJrNb73cNeibNDnxDRBdRyiaL5T0pVJKk/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&watermark=1&tp=webp#imgIndex=1", "type": "img"}, {"text": "2026 年 11 月 13—15 日（13 日报到，14—15 日会期）", "type": "p"}, {"text": "会议地点", "type": "p"}, {"text": "贵州 · 贵阳", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "图片", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/no8YFGgia2NFjctk4WAqUE8kwFgJQicb3GiaibQT9h1b8VfRicmWdRpCicyR7l6ibic1fk0Nia9eTib2h9CFYe8Ohq0vWsibQFLQb91w8eVut7tKmkGX4c/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg&watermark=1&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&tp=webp#img